ri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75295893_1122035958805707_3976827415305179869_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wz-XzZ9gyOsQ7kNvwGiGgIP&_nc_oc=AdoddhDw5-wMH3xT2i0TrND4neQn-LMsQ2Di-DC7ZPdSqx3s3ot4SdddZ5tdEdvf97o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDYBCajvDAFwDWcfErM_DAxvSemJPHw_792mAtc42eP1Q&oe=6A622B81"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_VROO3.png", "id": "285314937333520", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035431_285314940666853_7917901485208087798_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wRxb-bdbXYgQ7kNvwEo4avg&_nc_oc=Adqzj82OSyMndPoXhbuibLn4P4qHayxmAewROsC9ZWEhJHxpEs1DuAoRT6o0uirnD8M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBBsfxrpJVDoCL0b1wnB0Ma-6anARxN5RdyPdFMglDiow&oe=6A621CE6"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_VROO5.png", "id": "381136241036217", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982584_381136244369550_483176816840528973_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZywVMHgDCz4Q7kNvwEy9B5q&_nc_oc=Adq-wGO7PFlgqzgjJJA_Yrlbk_ZSI4Gw6GdDDzGSgReZ_OU4cP0mhIuIoXIyvW121nw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQC9-QIA9AdWivD2xbMJgQNYbrhL5r6nqUKBQrLSNQ1KNA&oe=6A622D7A"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_VROO6.png", "id": "2169394943393371", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974513_2169394946726704_833013698734162480_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7R5qMmX-AnQQ7kNvwErCarb&_nc_oc=Adq7P51jFGaT1CUTob83pHxwLWanlU9-k6vQqR9fiLMadrxHm9kDrJUMK8ftYoqBTpA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAgzSpGR4M8qUCNBMoJKm0yp7iXL8cpiqLYx4JZZGNGCg&oe=6A622F4A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover image.png", "id": "1048298189708781", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003240_1048298193042114_5639017989450219791_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DvBDqe9edM8Q7kNvwHJTqGI&_nc_oc=AdqFm0lFDD8hy4AEyGv7UALuITcPWy4GOMvKT5IPzijxCpE3ehM9ix6FRwzPRsRI5-s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCpuiD42JBjIAtK5Tx5PfijnhsdKkPiFYQ9bFxNEs4ZIA&oe=6A622A7D"}, "display_name": "VROO 360", "keywords": [], "long_description": "VROO est une solution cl\u00e9-en-main pour pr\u00e9senter des films 360\u00b0 \u00e0 votre public sur les appareils Meta Quest. Notre agence vous accompagne dans la cr\u00e9ation d\u2019un programme VR parfait pour votre \u00e9v\u00e9nement !\n> S\u00e9lectionnez vos films dans notre catalogue. VROO offre plus de 30 exp\u00e9riences (Fiction, Documentaire, Exp\u00e9rimental, Nature & D\u00e9couverte, Enfants, etc.) ;\n> Lancer l\u2019application et t\u00e9l\u00e9chargez vos films en utilisant un code PIN;\n> Profitez de votre application VROO personnalis\u00e9e : Une interface simple et ergonomique en mode kiosque qui permet \u00e0 vos spectateurs de d\u00e9marrer les films en utilisant leur regard.\n\nPour plus d\u2019informations, contactez notre \u00e9quipe :  hello@diversioncinema.com\n\n\nVROO is a simple solution to showcase 360\u00b0 movies to your audience on Meta Quest devices. Our agency helps you build the perfect VR program for your event!\n> Choose your movies from our catalog. VROO offers more than 30 experiences (Fiction, Documentary, Experimental, Nature & Discovery, Kids, etc.);\n> Launch the application and download your movies using a pin code;\n> Enjoy your personalized VROO app: A simple and ergonomic interface in kiosk mode that allows your spectators to play the movies using their gaze. \nFor more information, contact our team: hello@diversioncinema.com", "short_description": "Pr\u00e9sentez des films 360\u00b0 \u00e0 votre publique en toute simplicit\u00e9 !\nThe easiest way to showcase 360 VR movies to your audience!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vroo.io/Legal-Notice", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Diversion cinem